          "content": {
            "size": 201155,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "      \n\n{\"message\":\"\",\"error\":0,\"request\":{\"query\":null,\"timestamp\":1783997164},\"search_result\":[{\"event_id\":\"200030259970605\",\"eventname\":\"\\ud83c\\udfc3 FREE P.A.C. Trial Day | Where Kids Become Athletes\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events3\\/banners\\/86b8d3d9194c3366d67ca6d6ca325daabe02661748853d66e966d0d36e305104-rimg-w1200-h1553-dc12133e-gmir?v=1783905700\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events3\\/banners\\/86b8d3d9194c3366d67ca6d6ca325daabe02661748853d66e966d0d36e305104-rimg-w1200-h1553-dc12133e-gmir?v=1783905700\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events3\\/banners\\/86b8d3d9194c3366d67ca6d6ca325daabe02661748853d66e966d0d36e305104-rimg-w1200-h1553-dc12133e-gmir?v=1783905700\",\"start_time\":\"1783965600\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"Join us for a FREE Peak Athletic Conditioning (P.A.C.) Trial Day at The Pacific Campus!\\n\\nP.A.C. is our small-group athletic training program designed to help young athletes ages 10\\u201318 improve overall athletic performance through expert coaching and purposeful training.\\n\\nLed by a PC Certified Personal Trainer, athletes will work on:\\n\\n\\u26a1 Speed\\n\\ud83c\\udfc3 Agility\\n\\ud83d\\udcaa Strength\\n\\ud83d\\udd25 Endurance\\n\\u2b50 Confidence\\n\\ud83c\\udfaf Athletic Performance\\n\\nWhether your child is a seasoned athlete or just getting started, P.A.C. helps build the foundation needed to excel in any sport.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd Location: Energy Zone\\n\\ud83d\\udd55 Time: 6:00\\u20137:00 PM\\n\\ud83d\\udc65 Ages: 10\\u201318\\n\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Limited to 20 athletes\\n\\nFREE for Members AND Non-Members, so bring a buddy!\\n\\nLove the class? Participants who enroll in P.A.C. after their trial will receive 25% OFF their first month.\\n\\nReserve your spot today by calling or texting 509-783-5465.\\n\\nUpcoming Trial Dates:\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 July 13\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 August 10\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 September 14\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 October 12\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 November 9\\n\\n#WhereKidsBecomeAthletes #YouthSports #AthleticTraining #ThePacificCampus #PACTraining #TriCitiesKids #YouthAthletes\",\"end_time\":\"1783969200\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"1350 North Grant St., Kennewick, WA, United States, Washington 99336\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"1350 N Grant St, Kennewick, WA 99336-1355, United States\",\"venue\":\"1350 North Grant St., Kennewick, WA, United States, Washington 99336\",\"city\":\"Kennewick\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.22474\",\"longitude\":\"-119.19301\",\"full_address\":\"1350 North Grant St., Kennewick, WA, United States, Washington 99336\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/event\\/200030259970605?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/200030259970605?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Kennewick on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfc3 FREE P.A.C. Trial Day | Where Kids Become Athletes \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/200030259970605?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Kennewick on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfc3 FREE P.A.C. Trial Day | Where Kids Become Athletes \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/200030259970605?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/event\\/200030259970605\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030343630241\",\"eventname\":\"Coming Home to Yourself: Cancer New Moon Gathering with Lacey  \",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/9e056cc028c6a621c0e00019ba9c48ed48829a11adba9d2ab2af0caed0bbc8e3-rimg-w1200-h1200-dcffffff-gmir?v=1783771715\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/9e056cc028c6a621c0e00019ba9c48ed48829a11adba9d2ab2af0caed0bbc8e3-rimg-w1200-h1200-dcffffff-gmir?v=1783771715\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/9e056cc028c6a621c0e00019ba9c48ed48829a11adba9d2ab2af0caed0bbc8e3-rimg-w1200-h1200-dcffffff-gmir?v=1783771715\",\"start_time\":\"1783965600\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"\\ud83c\\udf11 This Cancer New Moon invites us to remember that home isn\\u2019t just a place\\u2014it\\u2019s a feeling we carry within ourselves.\\nTogether we\\u2019ll move through a gentle yoga practice, meditation, reflection, and a creative ritual where you\\u2019ll decorate your own wooden house with words, symbols, and intentions that remind you of who you are at your core. Let it become a small sacred reminder that no matter where life takes you, you are always home within yourself.\\n\\nCome slow down, reconnect with your heart, and create something meaningful to take home.\\n\\n\\u2728 Yoga \\u2022 Meditation \\u2022 Journaling \\u2022 Creative Ritual\\ud83c\\udf11 ~\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd49\\ud83c\\udf11\\u264b\\ufe0f\\nThe New Moon Gathering is a gathering of Moon-lovers who want to live life in rhythm with the Moon and Earth's natural cycles.\\nThe New Moon is all about new beginnings, a fresh start and a perfect time to set intentions for the new lunar cycle. It\\u2019s a time to draw inwards and connect to our deepest desires and needs. At this gathering you will be guided through an intention setting ceremony and Yin Yoga practice created to help you capture the healing energy of the New Moon.\\nYin yoga is a slow practice, focused on stretching the connective tissues deep within the body and cultivating peace through stillness. This practice will help connect your mind, body and soul while bringing you back into alignment with Earth\\u2019s natural cycles.\\n \\nThis event takes place at our Kennewick location:\\n5608 W Clearwater Ave A120\\nKennewick WA. 99336\\n\\nClass size limited\\nSign up is required\\n\\nThis event cost $7. \\n\\nSign up at https:\\/\\/www.liftedlotusyogacollective.com\\/yoga-scheduled \",\"end_time\":\"1783970100\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"Lifted Lotus Yoga\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"5608 W Clearwater Ave,Kennewick, Washington\",\"venue\":\"Lifted Lotus Yoga\",\"city\":\"Kennewick\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.21268352783\",\"longitude\":\"-119.19281768799\",\"full_address\":\"Lifted Lotus Yoga, 5608 W Clearwater Ave,Kennewick, Washington, United States\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/event\\/200030343630241?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/200030343630241?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Kennewick on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nComing Home to Yourself: Cancer New Moon Gathering with Lacey   \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/200030343630241?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Kennewick on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nComing Home to Yourself: Cancer New Moon Gathering with Lacey   \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/200030343630241?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/kennewick\\/event\\/200030343630241\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030356884509\",\"eventname\":\"iPlay FREE (Private Event) Monday, July 13, 2026 from 6-8 PM\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events2\\/banners\\/879ddd6ff030d3276c4715dbc47b2455bf61c24aac6abd9adfee5485f3270712-rimg-w1200-h1553-dc1272b6-gmir?v=1783905701\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events2\\/banners\\/879ddd6ff030d3276c4715dbc47b2455bf61c24aac6abd9adfee5485f3270712-rimg-w1200-h1553-dc1272b6-gmir?v=1783905701\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events2\\/banners\\/879ddd6ff030d3276c4715dbc47b2455bf61c24aac6abd9adfee5485f3270712-rimg-w1200-h1553-dc1272b6-gmir?v=1783905701\",\"start_time\":\"1783965600\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"Hi friends of the Benton-Franklin Counties Special Education PTA! Did you know we\\u2019ve partnered with iPlay to bring free monthly inclusive events?\\n\\nOur next private event is Monday, July 13, 2026 from 6:00 to 8:00 PM. The last day to register is Monday, July 13, by 12:00 PM. \\n\\nThis event is inclusive and welcomes all ages and abilities. With a suggested age of 12 or younger. \\n\\nPlease give a big thank you to iPlay for their generosity and hospitality! We look forward to seeing you all there! \\n\\nWhen: Monday, July 13, 2026\\nTime: 6:00 to 8:00 PM\\nLocation: 8524 Gage Blvd. #b110 Kennewick, Washington 99336\\nCost: Free. Socks are $3 (if needed)\\n\\nRegistration is required: https:\\/\\/forms.gle\\/zyqpDwmmtmofDh7H7\\n\\nSave time and complete the waiver. The waiver must be completed every year.\\nhttps:\\/\\/iplayexperience.aluvii.com\\/employee\\/Waiver\\/SignWaiver2?waiverId=1\\n\\nReminder to bring your iplay socks or you\\u2019ll need to purchase a pair for $3.\\n\\nWe look forward to seeing you all there! Let\\u2019s all let iplay know how much we appreciate their generosity and support.\\n\\nEmail: bfcsepta@yahoo.com if you have any questions.\\n__________________________________\\n\\u00a1Hola amigos de la PTA de Educaci\\u00f3n Especial de los Condados Benton-Franklin! \\u00bfSab\\u00edan que nos hemos asociado con iplay para ofrecer eventos inclusivos gratuitos cada mes? \\n\\nNuestro pr\\u00f3ximo evento es el lunes 13 julio de 2026, de 6:00 a 8:00 p.m. El \\u00faltimo d\\u00eda para inscribirse es el lunes 13 de julio, antes de las 12:00 p.m.\\n\\nEste evento es inclusivo y da la bienvenida a todas las edades y habilidades. Con una edad sugerida de 12 a\\u00f1os o menos. \\u00a1Por favor, den un gran agradecimiento a iPlay por su generosidad y hospitalidad! \\u00a1Esperamos verlos a todos all\\u00ed!\\n\\nCu\\u00e1ndo:  Lunes, 13 de julio de 2026\\nHora: 6:00 a 8:00 PM\\nLugar: 8524 Gage Blvd. #b110 Kennewick, Washington 99336\\nCosto: Gratis - Calcetines $3 (si son necesarios)\\n\\nSe requiere inscripci\\u00f3n: https:\\/\\/forms.gle\\/zyqpDwmmtmofDh7H7\\n\\nAhorra tiempo y completa la exenci\\u00f3n aqu\\u00ed: https:\\/\\/iplayexperience.aluvii.com\\/employee\\/Waiver\\/SignWaiver2?waiverId=1\\n\\nRecuerden traer sus calcetines de iplay o tendr\\u00e1n que comprar un par por $3. \\u00a1Esperamos verlos a todos all\\u00ed! Hagamos saber a iplay cu\\u00e1nto apreciamos su generosidad y apoyo. \\n\\nCorreo electr\\u00f3nico: bfcsepta@yahoo.com si tienen alguna pregunta.\",\"end_time\":\"1783972800\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"Iplay experience\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"8524 W Gage Blvd, Kennewick, WA 99336-8241, United States\",\"venue\":\"Iplay experience\",\"city\":\"Kennewick\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.2