\"end_time\":\"1783969200\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"227 Symons St, Richland, WA, United States, Washington 99354\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"227 Symons St, Richland, WA 99354-3423, United States\",\"venue\":\"227 Symons St, Richland, WA, United States, Washington 99354\",\"city\":\"Richland\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.28939\",\"longitude\":\"-119.27557\",\"full_address\":\"227 Symons St, Richland, WA, United States, Washington 99354\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/richland\\/event\\/200030386290148?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/richland\\/200030386290148?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Richland on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nMagic The Gathering Mondays \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/richland\\/200030386290148?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Richland on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nMagic The Gathering Mondays \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/richland\\/200030386290148?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/richland\\/event\\/200030386290148\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030400534343\",\"eventname\":\"Auditions: Steel Magnolias\",\"thumb_url\":\"\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"\",\"banner_url\":\"\",\"start_time\":\"1783967400\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"All the ladies who are \\u201canybody\\u201d in Chinquapin, Louisiana come to Truvy\\u2019s beauty salon to have their hair done, even while tragedy lurks and hope thrives.\\n\\nAuditions for \\\"Steel Magnolias\\\" by Robert Harling, directed by Kristin Lerch, will be 6:30 PM Sunday and Monday, July 12 &amp; 13 at the Princess Theatre, 1228 Meade Avenue, Prosser, WA.\\n\\nCold readings in your best southern accent will be part of the audition. Rehearsals are currently planned for Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday evenings, with performances September 10, 11, 12 &amp; 13 at the Princess Theatre.\\n\\nCharacters and age ranges:\\n\\n\\u2022 Truvy Jones:\\nRole: Owner of the beauty salon.\\nDescription: Truvy is in her 40s\\/50s, quick-witted, kind, and funny.\\n\\n\\u2022 Annelle Dupuy-Desoto\\nRole: Truvy's new assistant.\\nDescription: 19- to early 20's, Annelle is navigating her newfound independence after a troubled marriage.\\n\\n\\u2022 Shelby Eatenton-Latcherie\\nRole: M\\u2019Lynn's daughter.\\nDescription: Shelby is in her 20s, described as the prettiest girl in town. She is strong-willed, independent, and caring, but her battle with Type 1 Diabetes complicates her life.\\n\\n\\u2022 M\\u2019Lynn Eatenton\\nRole: Shelby's mother.\\nDescription: In her late 40s to early 50s, M\\u2019Lynn is intelligent, intuitive, and protective of her daughter.\\n\\n\\u2022 Clairee Belcher\\nRole: Wealthy widow and former first lady of Chinquapin.\\nDescription: In her mid-60s\\/70s, Clairee is sharp-tongued, classy, and humorous. She navigates life after her husband's death and provides comic relief while also showing deep care for her friends.\\n\\n\\u2022 Ouiser Boudreaux\\nRole: Clairee's lifelong friend.\\nDescription: Also in her mid-60s\\/70s, Ouiser is a wealthy, eccentric curmudgeon known for her bluntness and sarcasm. Despite her tough exterior, she is fiercely loyal to her friends.\\n\\nQuestions? Please contact Kristin Lerch at lerchpage@gmail.com.\\n\\nAuditions: Sunday, July 12 &amp; Monday, July 13 at 6:30 PM\\n\\nPerformances will be held September 10, 11, 12, &amp; 13.\",\"end_time\":\"1783978200\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"1228 Meade Ave, Prosser, WA, United States, Washington 99350\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"1228 meade ave prosser wa united states washington 99350, Prosser, WA\",\"venue\":\"1228 Meade Ave, Prosser, WA, United States, Washington 99350\",\"city\":\"Prosser\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.20608\",\"longitude\":\"-119.76879\",\"full_address\":\"1228 Meade Ave, Prosser, WA, United States, Washington 99350\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/prosser\\/event\\/200030400534343?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/prosser\\/200030400534343?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Prosser on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nAuditions: Steel Magnolias \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/prosser\\/200030400534343?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Prosser on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nAuditions: Steel Magnolias \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/prosser\\/200030400534343?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/prosser\\/event\\/200030400534343\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030277026847\",\"eventname\":\"Midnight Coterie\",