a, US\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/yakima\\/event\\/1600029319839357?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/yakima\\/1600029319839357?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Yakima on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nYakima Valley YSA Branch Family Home Evening \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/yakima\\/1600029319839357?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Yakima on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nYakima Valley YSA Branch Family Home Evening \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/yakima\\/1600029319839357?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/yakima\\/event\\/1600029319839357\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030244755836\",\"eventname\":\"Messy Wearable Art Camp- Turtle Splash @ Happily Painted Studio\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events4\\/banners\\/a110e4e14cb25b8bc2226c65b9206c2271836ef1f74423a4fff04ae4497b3862-rimg-w1200-h628-dc126091-gmir?v=1783897822\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events4\\/banners\\/a110e4e14cb25b8bc2226c65b9206c2271836ef1f74423a4fff04ae4497b3862-rimg-w1200-h628-dc126091-gmir?v=1783897822\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events4\\/banners\\/a110e4e14cb25b8bc2226c65b9206c2271836ef1f74423a4fff04ae4497b3862-rimg-w1200-h628-dc126091-gmir?v=1783897822\",\"start_time\":\"1783944000\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"\\ud83c\\udfa8\\ud83c\\udf08 Messy &amp; Wearable Art Camp at Happily Painted Studio \\ud83c\\udf08\\ud83c\\udfa8\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 July 13th\\u201316th\\n\\ud83d\\udd5b 12PM\\u20132PM\\n\\ud83d\\udc67 Ages 6\\u201312\\n\\nGet ready for one of the MOST colorful, messy, creative camps of the summer! Our Messy &amp; Wearable Art Camp is packed with splatter paint, squirt gun art, tie dye, wearable creations, and fun painting projects that kids will LOVE to bring home.\\n\\nThis camp is all about creativity, self-expression, bright colors, and having FUN while learning new art techniques in a welcoming and encouraging environment.\\n\\n\\u2728 CAMP LINEUP \\u2728\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc22 Monday \\u2014 Turtle Splash Day\\nKids will paint an adorable, colorful turtle canvas, then add exciting splatter art around their painting for a fun, messy effect!\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfa8 Extra Project:\\nKids will sculpt and paint their very own sea turtle out of clay to take home.\\n\\n\\u2728 Artists will learn:\\n\\u2022 Beginner acrylic painting techniques\\n\\u2022 Color layering and blending\\n\\u2022 Splatter paint techniques\\n\\u2022 Basic clay sculpting and painting\\n\\n\\ud83d\\ude04 Tuesday \\u2014 Smiley Face Splatter Day\\nArtists will paint a bright, happy smiley face canvas and then use squirt guns filled with paint to create explosive, colorful backgrounds around their artwork!\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf08 Extra Project:\\nCreate your own splatter paint shirt or tote bag using squirt guns, splatter paint, and bright neon colors!\\n\\n\\u2728 Artists will learn:\\n\\u2022 Background painting techniques\\n\\u2022 Creative color combinations\\n\\u2022 Action painting and splatter effects\\n\\u2022 Wearable art design and personalization\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf44 Wednesday \\u2014 Mushroom Madness\\nKids will paint whimsical, colorful mushrooms before using squirt guns to splatter and spray the mushroom polka dots and backgrounds for a super fun mixed-media effect.\\n\\n\\u2728 Extra Project:\\nNeon and glow-in-the-dark tie-dye creations! Bring your favorite shirt to tie-dye, or select the ticket option that includes a t-shirt and we will take care of the rest. Please be sure to include your child\\u2019s shirt size in the comments at checkout.\\n\\n\\u2728 Artists will learn:\\n\\u2022 Mixed media painting techniques\\n\\u2022 Texture and layering effects\\n\\u2022 Fun paint application methods\\n\\u2022 Tie-dye folding and color blending techniques\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf38 Thursday \\u2014 Abstract Flower Explosion\\nArtists will splatter paint colorful abstract backgrounds before layering bright, whimsical flowers over the top to create a vibrant final masterpiece.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfa8 Extra Project:\\nCreate fun wood teardrop earrings or pendants with colorful splatter paint and whimsical flower details layered over the top. Also create some fun textured slime.\\n\\n\\u2728 Artists will learn:\\n\\u2022 Abstract painting techniques\\n\\u2022 Painting flowers with simple brush strokes\\n\\u2022 Composition and layering\\n\\u2022 Jewelry and wearable art design\\n\\n\\u2728 Throughout the week, kids will explore:\\n\\u2022 Acrylic painting\\n\\u2022 Splatter techniques\\n\\u2022 Tie dye\\n\\u2022 Wearable art\\n\\u2022 Mixed media\\n\\u2022 Texture techniques\\n\\u2022 Creative self-expression\\n\\n\\u2728 Small class sizes help ensure every child has an enjoyable experience while learning the basics of art and trying exciting new techniques.\\n\\n\\ud83e\\udd64 Small snacks and drinks will be provided during camp. Please let us know about any allergies before the event. If you have any questions or concerns, we are always happy to help!\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd Happily Painted Studio \\u2013 Selah, WA\\n\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Space is limited!\\n\\nIf your child will be attending camp as a drop-off participant, a parent or guardian must complete an emergency contact and pickup authorization form before camp.\",\"end_time\":\"1783951200\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"115 E. Third Ave, Selah, WA, United States, Washington 98942\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"113 E 3rd Ave, Selah, WA 98942-1430, United States\",\"venue\":\"115 E. Third Ave, Selah, WA, United States, Washington 98942\",\"city\":\"Selah\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.65128\",\"longitude\":\"-120.52971\",\"full_address\":\"115 E. Third Ave, Selah, WA, United States, Washington 98942\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/selah\\/event\\/200030244755836?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/selah\\/200030244755836?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Selah on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nMessy Wearable Art Camp- Turtle Splash @ Happily Painted Studio \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/selah\\/200030244755836?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Selah on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nMessy Wearable Art Camp- Turtle Splash @ Happily Painted Studio \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/selah\\/200030244755836?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/selah\\/event\\/200030244755836\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030361872409\",\"eventname\":\"Messy Wearable Art Camp- Turtle Splash Day For Teens and Adults @ Happily Painted Studio\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events10\\/banners\\/fb0ac25d1efacf7c44ab04d643d59db01636818d71687e555a2151921d0523d0-rimg-w1200-h628-dc126091-gmir?v=1783977698\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events10\\/banners\\/fb0ac25d1efacf7c44ab04d643d59db01636818d71687e555a2151921d0523d0-rimg-w1200-h628-dc126091-gmir?v=1783977698\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events10\\/banners\\/fb0ac25d1efacf7c44ab04d643d59db01636818d71687e555a2151921d0523d0-rimg-w1200-h628-dc126091-gmir?v=1783977698\",\"start_time\":\"1783965600\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"\\ud83c\\udfa8\\ud83c\\udf08 Messy &amp; Wearable Art Camp at Happily Painted Studio \\ud83c\\udf08\\ud83c\\udfa8\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 July 13th &amp;16th\\n\\ud83d\\udd5b 6PM\\u20138PM\\n\\ud83d\\udc67 For teens and adults\\n\\nGet ready for one of the MOST colorful, messy, creative camps of the summer! Our Messy &amp; Wearable Art Camp is packed with splatter paint, squirt gun art, tie-dye, wearable creations, and fun painting projects that kids will LOVE to bring home.\\n\\nThis camp is all about creativity, self-expression, bright colors, and having FUN while learning new art techniques in a welcoming and encouraging environment.\\n\\n\\u2728 CAMP LINEUP \\u2728\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc22 Monday \\u2014 Turtle Splash Day\\nArtists will paint an adorable, colorful turtle canvas, then add exciting splatter art around their painting for a fun, messy effect!\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfa8 Extra Project:\\nKids will sculpt and paint their very own sea turtle out of clay to take home.\\n\\n\\u2728 Artists will learn:\\n\\u2022 Beginner acrylic painting techniques\\n\\u2022 Color layering and blending\\n\\u2022 Splatter paint techniques\\n\\u2022 Basic clay sculpting and painting\\n\\n \",\"end_time\":\"1783972800\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"115 E. Third Ave, Selah, WA, United States, Washington 98942\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"113 E 3rd Ave, Selah, WA 98