az.allevents.in\\/events10\\/banners\\/e857a0b9be1d4378e1f9e5bad98bb05e4fcc236c53e0fa299a57dd1ace783e48-rimg-w1000-h1000-dc784514-gmir?v=1783614007\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events10\\/banners\\/e857a0b9be1d4378e1f9e5bad98bb05e4fcc236c53e0fa299a57dd1ace783e48-rimg-w1000-h1000-dc784514-gmir?v=1783614007\",\"start_time\":\"1783969200\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"The Vulcanfeldt Business Meeting happens on the second Monday of every month at 7 PM. Everyone in the populace is welcome. Your ideas help shape the barony, and your voice matters.\\n\\nAt each meeting, officers share clear updates about their areas. These updates cover events, arts and sciences, martial activities, youth programs, and outreach. You can ask questions, offer suggestions, and learn what is happening in the barony. This meeting is the best place to stay informed.\\n\\nWe also highlight volunteer opportunities. You can help with event setup, gate, teaching, retaining, or simple support tasks. Volunteering is a great way to meet people and learn new skills. Every role helps the barony grow.\\n\\nThe Vulcanfeldt Business Meeting is also a chance to connect with others. You can hear about upcoming activities and find ways to get involved. Newcomers are welcome, and long\\u2011time members can share experience and guidance. We encourage everyone to attend and take part in the work that keeps our community strong.\\n\\nYour presence matters. Your ideas matter. When you join us, you help build the future of Vulcanfeldt.\\n\\nMany people arrive at 6:30 pm to order food and socialize. We hope to see you there!\",\"end_time\":\"1783972800\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"Round Table Pizza (1300 N 40th Ave, Yakima, WA)\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"1300 N 40th Ave,Yakima, Washington\",\"venue\":\"Round Table Pizza (1300 N 40th Ave, Yakima, WA)\",\"city\":\"Yakima\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"46.62108\",\"longitude\":\