975-rimg-w1200-h675-dcbdbfa9-gmir?v=1783280566\",\"start_time\":\"1783362600\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"Join us for this weekly gathering to work in the Trinity Garden.  \\n\\nWe recommend that you bring the following tools if you have them on hand to make our time more productive:\\n1.  Bucket for collecting weeds\\n2.  W**d popper and\\/or hand spade\\n3.  Garden gloves \\n4.  Hand trimmers\\n5.  Bottle of water\\n\\nAll ages are welcome!  Please come and enjoy the garden!  Even if its just to enjoy the banter and company!! Plan on this being about an hour to an hour and a half.\\n\\nIf you are not able to join in person or if you hope to come but are unable to do the physical work we would invite you to support our work in prayer. Here are some prayers already written to use as a starting point: https:\\/\\/tinyurl.com\\/2a8j7bxr\\n\",\"end_time\":\"1783967400\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 06\",\"location\":\"850 N James Ave, East Wenatchee, WA 98802-4663, United States\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"850 N James Ave, East Wenatchee, WA 98802-4663, United States\",\"venue\":\"850 N James Ave, East Wenatchee, WA 98802-4663, United States\",\"city\":\"East Wenatche\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.41741\",\"longitude\":\"-120.27023\",\"full_address\":\"850 N James Ave, East Wenatchee, WA 98802-4663, United States, 850 N James Ave, East Wenatchee, WA 98802-4663, United States, East Wenatche\"},\"label\":\"\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/east-wenatche\\/event\\/200030358413346?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/east-wenatche\\/200030358413346?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in East Wenatche on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nGarden Work Party \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/east-wenatche\\/200030358413346?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\