n the full Armor of God and stand strong in our faith. Through exciting Bible lessons, games, worship, crafts, missions activities, and team challenges, kids will discover that God has given them everything they need to follow Jesus every day. We can\\u2019t wait to train alongside you for this unforgettable adventure! \\n\\nRegister online at: https:\\/\\/www.saddlerockepc.org\\/children\",\"end_time\":\"1784289600\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"1400 S Miller St, Wenatchee, WA, United States, Washington 98801\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"1400 S Miller St, Wenatchee, WA 98801-3260, United States\",\"venue\":\"1400 S Miller St, Wenatchee, WA, United States, Washington 98801\",\"city\":\"Wenatchee\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.40333\",\"longitude\":\"-120.32554\",\"full_address\":\"1400 S Miller St, Wenatchee, WA, United States, Washington 98801\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/event\\/200030301935747?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/200030301935747?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Wenatchee on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nVacation Bible School Bible Boot Camp \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/200030301935747?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Wenatchee on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nVacation Bible School Bible Boot Camp \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/200030301935747?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/event\\/200030301935747\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":\"17\",\"interested_count\":1,\"custom_params\":{\"interested_count\":1,\"total_interested_count\":1},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"13-17 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030084875740\",\"eventname\":\"Super Summer Adventures - The Great No-Bake Off\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events4\\/banners\\/bd6e79c45b631885769881489d17c2610d477ee099221b64b7d769954fbe67b3-rimg-w1200-h700-dcf2f2f2-gmir?v=1783693440\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events4\\/banners\\/bd6e79c45b631885769881489d17c2610d477ee099221b64b7d769954fbe67b3-rimg-w1200-h700-dcf2f2f2-gmir?v=1783693440\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events4\\/banners\\/bd6e79c45b631885769881489d17c2610d477ee099221b64b7d769954fbe67b3-rimg-w1200-h700-dcf2f2f2-gmir?v=1783693440\",\"start_time\":\"1783933200\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"STEAM-Powered Adventures Await!\\nAt the museum, our camps bring STEAM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Art, and Math) to life with an exciting focus on arts and engineering. From building robots to exploring time travel and whipping up culinary creations, our camps spark curiosity through imaginative themes and hands-on activities. \\n\\nEach week is a new adventure, blending creativity, innovation, and discovery. Wherever our explorations take us, one thing\\u2019s for sure\\u2014your child will be at the center of the fun! Join us this summer for unforgettable STEAM-powered experiences! \\n\\nThe Great No-Bake-Off: No-Bake Cooking Camp \\n\\nGet read to mix, mash, and munch your way through a week of culinary creativity! Campers will experiment with all kinds of snacks and treats, building their own edible masterpieces while exploring new flavors and combinations. This camp is perfect for adventurous eaters who love to try new things. A variety of ingredients may be used throughout the week, so if you child has food allergies, please reach out to us before registering to discuss any questions.\",\"end_time\":\"1784214000\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"127 S Mission St, Wenatchee, WA, United States, Washington 98801\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"127 S Mission St, Wenatchee, WA 98801-3039, United States\",\"venue\":\"127 S Mission St, Wenatchee, WA, United States, Washington 98801\",\"city\":\"Wenatchee\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.42244\",\"longitude\":\"-120.31085\",\"full_address\":\"127 S Mission St, Wenatchee, WA, United States, Washington 98801\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/event\\/200030084875740?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/200030084875740?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Wenatchee on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nSuper Summer Adventures - The Great No-Bake Off \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/200030084875740?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Wenatchee on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nSuper Summer Adventures - The Great No-Bake Off \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/200030084875740?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/wenatchee\\/event\\/200030084875740\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":\"16\",\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"13-16 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030331017727\",\"even