2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030397760636\",\"eventname\":\"Weekly Boardgame Night!\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events5\\/banners\\/8833fafc70a3b225c7300c7385c535a40e8a4115f70e5b1765c5fd8f3efd96e0-rimg-w1170-h1128-dcf6f7f7-gmir?v=1783981520\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events5\\/banners\\/8833fafc70a3b225c7300c7385c535a40e8a4115f70e5b1765c5fd8f3efd96e0-rimg-w1170-h1128-dcf6f7f7-gmir?v=1783981520\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events5\\/banners\\/8833fafc70a3b225c7300c7385c535a40e8a4115f70e5b1765c5fd8f3efd96e0-rimg-w1170-h1128-dcf6f7f7-gmir?v=1783981520\",\"start_time\":\"1783963800\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"**updated schedule**\\nBeginning 7\\/6\\/26, regular game nights will be held at the Hood River Public Library meeting room during the first two Mondays of each month.\\n\\nThere will be a featured post reminder on this group's page with an updated calendar for reminders.\\n\\nInclusive, friendly environment for all ages. No prior experience required! Just bring a great attitude! We have members who bring plenty of games and who are ready to teach how to play their games! Games are typically not mass market games, but you'll find members who will join you in them! \\n\\n Questions? Send me or the admins a DM! We are also a very active group on Discord. If you haven't joined the Discord server yet, check out the Featured post in this group for a link to the Discord server!\\n\\nPictured: Wingspan\",\"end_time\":\"1783980000\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"Hood River County Library District\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"502 State St,Hood River,OR,United States\",\"venue\":\"Hood River County Library District\",\"city\":\"Hood River\",\"state\":\"OR\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"45.708415082331\",\"longitude\":\"-121.51544046519\",\"full_address\":\"Hood River County Library District, 502 State St,Hood River,OR,United States\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/event\\/200030397760636?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/200030397760636?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Hood River on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nWeekly Boardgame Night! \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/200030397760636?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Hood River on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nWeekly Boardgame Night! \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/200030397760636?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/event\\/200030397760636\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030333859130\",\"eventname\":\"Salsa & Kizomba Class Series\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/7e1c90b786631d1b09fd899bfb05cf8ba951a36bb0386c6540b11ed16b692b43-rimg-w1200-h444-dc050506-gmir?v=1783492150\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/7e1c90b786631d1b09fd899bfb05cf8ba951a36bb0386c6540b11ed16b692b43-rimg-w1200-h444-dc050506-gmir?v=1783492150\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/7e1c90b786631d1b09fd899bfb05cf8ba951a36bb0386c6540b11ed16b692b43-rimg-w1200-h444-dc050506-gmir?v=1783492150\",\"start_time\":\"1783967400\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"\\ud83d\\udc83\\ud83d\\udd25 June may be ending, but we\\u2019re just getting started! \\ud83d\\udd25\\ud83d\\udc83\\n\\nNew series. New location. New night, 30 minutes earlier. Same great community.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd May Street Elementary (Gym)\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 Mondays: June 29, July 13, 20 &amp; 27 (No class July 6)\\n\\u23f0 6:30\\u20138:30 PM\\n\\ud83d\\udcb0 $60 per series\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc83 Crossbody Salsa Fundamentals (6:30\\u20137:30 PM)\\nMove beyond memorized patterns and learn how slot salsa really works. Develop connection, timing, turn technique, and partner communication in LA-style salsa.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf0d Kizomba (7:30\\u20138:30 PM)\\nMore than a dance, kizomba is a study in connection. Learn the fundamentals of this nuanced partner dance while developing musicality, comfort, and partner awareness that elevate your dancing across styles.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcdd Pre-registration required to help maintain balanced lead\\/follow roles:\\nhttps:\\/\\/forms.gle\\/os5d6URbwpZGYfwk9\",\"end_time\":\"1783974600\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"May Street Elementary School\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"1001 10th St,Hood River, Oregon\",\"venue\":\"May Street Elementary School\",\"city\":\"Hood River\",\"state\":\"OR\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"45.7030154\",\"longitude\":\"-121.5209751\",\"full_address\":\"May Street Elementary School, 1001 10th St,Hood River, Oregon, United States\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/event\\/200030333859130?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/200030333859130?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Hood River on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nSalsa & Kizomba Class Series \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/hood-river\\/200