l. Sunday - Thursday evenings, July 12th-16th, 6pm-8:30pm\\nREGISTER at this link https:\\/\\/cornerstonejohnday.churchcenter.com\\/registrations\\/signups\\/3699616\",\"end_time\":\"1783965600\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 12\",\"location\":\"Cornerstone Christian Fellowship\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"John Day, Oregon\",\"venue\":\"Cornerstone Christian Fellowship\",\"city\":\"John Day\",\"state\":\"OR\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"44.41691\",\"longitude\":\"-118.95097\",\"full_address\":\"Cornerstone Christian Fellowship, John Day, Oregon, United States\"},\"label\":\"Yesterday\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/john-day\\/event\\/200030304907632?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/john-day\\/200030304907632?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in John Day on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nVacation Bible School \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/john-day\\/200030304907632?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in John Day on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nVacation Bible School \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/john-day\\/200030304907632?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/john-day\\/event\\/200030304907632\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":true,\"ignore_date\":1},\"display_day\":\"12\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":\"13\",\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"has_slots\":true,\"ignore_date\":1,\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Ongoing\",\"display_time_label\":\"12-13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"100001991893632475\",\"eventname\":\"HR Leadership \\u2013 Build a Stronger Organization! in Spokane, WA\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events3\\/banners\\/8833cac128950fa8a209ec62eda9f9cd6493b9792115fff467e5d27a7121623f-rimg-w1200-h600-dcbf8c14-gmir.jpg?v=1782631817\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events3\\/banners\\/8833cac128950fa8a209ec62eda9f9cd6493b9792115fff467e5d27a7121623f-rimg-w1200-h600-dcbf8c14-gmir.jpg?v=1782631817\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events3\\/banners\\/8833cac128950fa8a209ec62eda9f9cd6493b9792115fff467e5d27a7121623f-rimg-w1200-h600-dcbf8c14-gmir.jpg?v=1782631817\",\"start_time\":\"1783933200\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"Master the skills to hire, manage &amp; lead with confidence-join our HR Leadership &amp; Workforce Management course and elevate your HR expertise!<br \\/><br \\/><b>About this Event<\\/b><br \\/><br \\/><p><strong><strong>Human Resource Management Course<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong><strong>Certificate:<\\/strong><\\/strong> Course Completion Certificate<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Duration<\\/strong><\\/strong>: 1 Day<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Course Delivery:<\\/strong><\\/strong> Classroom \\/ Virtual<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Language:<\\/strong><\\/strong><strong><strong> <\\/strong><\\/strong>English<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Credits:<\\/strong><\\/strong> 8<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Course Overview<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><p>Human Resource Management (HRM) is the backbone of any successful organization. This course provides a deep dive into modern HR practices, focusing on recruitment, onboarding, workplace safety, performance management, and compliance. You will gain hands-on experience with HR strategies that enhance employee engagement, promote a healthy work culture, and drive organizational success.<\\/p><p>Designed for HR professionals, business managers, and aspiring HR leaders, this course offers actionable insights into effective people management. Learn how to handle employee relations, navigate workplace challenges, and build a high-performing team while ensuring legal compliance and ethical practices.<\\/p><p><strong><strong>What You\\u2019ll Learn<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u2714 The evolution and modern role of Human Resources<br \\/>\\u2714 Effective interviewing and recruitment techniques<br \\/>\\u2714 Best practices for employee onboarding and orientation<br \\/>\\u2714 Strategies for ensuring workplace safety and compliance<br \\/>\\u2714 How to address harassment, discrimination, and workplace violence<br \\/>\\u2714 Performance management, appraisals, and feedback techniques<br \\/>\\u2714 Employee discipline and termination procedures<br \\/>\\u2714 Legal and ethical considerations in HR<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Course Modules<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong><strong>Module 1: Getting Started<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Icebreaker activities to introduce participants<\\/li><li>Housekeeping guidelines and course expectations<\\/li><li>Introduction to the \\u201cParking Lot\\u201d for questions and discussions<\\/li><li>Workshop objectives and learning outcomes<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 2: A History of Human Resources<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Evolution of HRM from past to present<\\/li><li>Understanding the role of HR in today\\u2019s business environment<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 3: The Interview Process<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Structuring interviews effectively<\\/li><li>Types of interview questions and their impact<\\/li><li>Legal and ethical considerations in interviewing<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 4: Employee Orientation<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Step-by-step guide to a successful onboarding process<\\/li><li>The role of HR vs. management in orientation<\\/li><li>Tips for engaging new employees from day one<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 5: Following Up with New Employees<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Creating an effective first-week checklist<\\/li><li>Strategies for continuous employee support<\\/li><li>Long-term engagement and retention techniques<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 6: Workplace Safety<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Employer and employee responsibilities in workplace safety<\\/li><li>Compliance with local and industry-specific regulations<\\/li><li>Building a culture of safety in the workplace<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 7: Dealing with Harassment and Discrimination<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Understanding different types of workplace harassment<\\/li><li>Identifying and preventing discrimination in the workplace<\\/li><li>HR and management\\u2019s role in ensuring a safe environment<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 8: Workplace Violence<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Recognizing early warning signs of workplace violence<\\/li><li>Strategies to prevent and address violence at work<\\/li><li>Employer and manager responsibilities in crisis situations<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 9: Managing Employee Performance<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Effective performance review techniques<\\/li><li>The role of continuous feedback and coaching<\\/li><li>Encouraging professional development and employee growth<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 10: Disciplining Employees<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>HR\\u2019s role in employee discipline<\\/li><li>Methods for handling difficult conversations<\\/li><li>Establishing fair and effective disciplinary measures<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 11: Terminating Employees<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Proper documentation for employee terminations<\\/li><li>Legal and ethical considerations when letting employees go<\\/li><li>Best practices for handling termination meetings<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Module 12: Wrapping Up<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Key takeaways from the course<\\/li><li>Actionable steps for implementing HR strategies<\\/li><li>Final Q&amp;A and participant evaluations<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong><strong>Who Should Attend?<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><p>This course is ideal for:<br \\/>\\u2714 HR professionals looking to upgrade their skills<br \\/>\\u2714 Business owners and managers handling HR functions<br \\/>\\u2714 Team leaders responsible for people management<br \\/>\\u2714 Entrepreneurs building their HR strategies<br \\/>\\u2714 Anyone interested in a career in Human Resource Management<\\/p><p><strong><strong>Why Enroll?<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u2705 Gain practical HR skills applicable to real-world scenarios<br \\/>\\u2705 Learn from experienced HR professionals and industry experts<br \\/>\\u2705 Improve your ability to manage employees effectively<br \\/>\\u2705 Stay up-to-date with the latest HR trends and best practices<br \\/>\\u2705 Earn a valuable certification to boost your career prospects<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/><b><u>Agenda<u style=\\\"font-size:16px;\\\"><\\/u><\\/u><\\/b><br \\/><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 09:00 AM - 09:15 AM<br \\/><b>Welcome and Introduction<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> The session will begin with a warm welcome and an introduction to the course, setting the expectations for the day. Participants will engage in an interactive icebreaker activity to foster a comfortable learning environment. An overview of key HR concepts and their significance in today\\u2019s dynamic workplace will be discussed to set the foundation for the training.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 09:15 AM - 10:15 AM<br \\/><b>The Evolution of Human Resource Management<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> In this session, participants will explore the history and transformation of Human Resource Management. They will gain insights into how HR has evolved from a purely administrative function to a strategic business partner. The discussion will cover HR\\u2019s critical role in driving business success and ensuring employee engagement, along with an overview of its key functions and responsibilities in modern organizations.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 10:15 AM - 10:30 AM<br \\/><b>Morning Tea Break \\u2615<\\/b><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 10:30 AM - 11:30 AM<br \\/><b>The Interview Process and Employee Onboarding<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> Participants will dive into the essentials of conducting effective interviews, focusing on how to structure interviews with the right format and questions. The session will highlight common hiring mistakes and biases to avoid. Additionally, best practices for employee orientation and onboarding will be explored, ensuring that new hires have a seamless transition into their roles and the company culture.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 11:30 AM - 12:15 PM<br \\/><b>Managing Employee Performance and Feedback<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> This session will cover strategies for implementing continuous feedback and conducting performance reviews that drive employee growth. Participants will learn how to encourage professional development and keep employees motivated through structured performance management techniques. The discussion will also touch on how to address performance challenges effectively while maintaining a positive work environment.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 12:15 PM - 12:45 PM<br \\/><b>Lunch Break <\\/b><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 12:45 PM - 01:45 PM<br \\/><b>Workplace Safety, Harassment, and Discrimination<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> The afternoon session will focus on workplace safety regulations and best practices to ensure compliance with legal and industry standards. Participants will gain a deeper understanding of harassment and discrimination in the workplace, learning how to identify, prevent, and address such issues. The discussion will also highlight the importance of fostering a safe, inclusive, and respectful workplace culture.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 01:45 PM - 02:45 PM<br \\/><b>Workplace Violence and Employee Discipline<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> In this session, participants will explore the different aspects of workplace violence, including early warning signs and prevention strategies. They will learn how to implement clear and structured disciplinary procedures to manage employee behavior professionally and fairly. The session will also focus on handling difficult conversations with employees while maintaining respect and compliance with organizational policies.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 02:45 PM - 03:00 PM<br \\/><b>Evening Tea Break \\u2615<\\/b><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 03:00 PM - 04:00 PM<br \\/><b>Employee Termination and Legal Considerations<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> This session will provide participants with a comprehensive understanding of employee termination procedures, covering both legal and ethical considerations. They will learn how to document employee performance issues correctly and ensure fair decision-making processes. The discussion will also focus on best practices for conducting termination meetings professionally while minimizing risks and maintaining workplace morale.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 04:00 PM - 04:45 PM<br \\/><b>HRM Case Studies and Interactive Discussion<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> Participants will engage in real-world case studies to analyze HR challenges and decision-making scenarios. Through group discussions and interactive activities, they will apply their learning to practical situations, share best practices, and gain insights from industry experts. This session will enhance their problem-solving skills and strategic thinking in HR management.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\\ud83d\\udd51: 04:45 PM - 05:00 PM<br \\/><b>Course Wrap-up and Q&amp;A<\\/b><br \\/><p style=\\\"margin-top:0;\\\"><b>Info:<\\/b> The training will conclude with a summary of key takeaways from the course, reinforcing the most important concepts covered throughout the day. Participants will have the opportunity to ask questions, clarify doubts, and discuss how they can apply the learnings in their professional roles. Additional resources will be provided to support continuous growth and development in the field of Human Resource Management.<\\/p><br \\/><br \\/>\",\"end_time\":\"1786554000\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"For venue details reach us at: info@kogniora.com\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"Spokane, WA\",\"venue\":\"For venue details reach us at: info@kogniora.com\",\"city\":\"Spokane, WA\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.66007159999999\",\"longitude\":\"-117.4316272\",\"full_address\":\"For venue details reach us at: info@kogniora.com, Spokane, WA, Spokane, WA, United States\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane-wa\\/event\\/100001991893632475?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane-wa\\/100001991893632475?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane, WA on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nHR Leadership \\u2013 Build a Stronger Organization! in Spokane, WA \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane-wa\\/100001991893632475?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane, WA on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nHR Leadership \\u2013 Build a Stronger Organization! in Spokane, WA \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane-wa\\/100001991893632475?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane-wa\\/event\\/100001991893632475\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false,\"ticket_currency\":\"USD\",\"min_ticket_price\":\"641.14\",\"max_ticket_price\":\"815.76\"},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false,\"ticket_currency\":\"USD\",\"min_ticket_price\":\"641.14\",\"max_ticket_price\":\"815.76\"},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":\"onwards\",\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"13 Jul-12 Aug\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"100001991010727683\",\"eventname\":\"Day + Night\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/dc724ba4f517fc34cc7ba4afa4527b3766e3b7ecdc43bbc3d0d5df4bed30e133-rimg-w1200-h675-dcf7f0e7-gmir.jpg?v=1780650254\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/dc724ba4f517fc34cc7ba4afa4527b3766e3b7ecdc43bbc3d0d5df4bed30e133-rimg-w1200-h675-dcf7f0e7-gmir.jpg?v=1780650254\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/dc724ba4f517fc34cc7ba4afa4527b3766e3b7ecdc43bbc3d0d5df4bed30e133-rimg-w1200-h675-dcf7f0e7-gmir.jpg?v=1780650254\",\"start_time\":\"1783963800\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"Make two mini moisturizers and learn how your skin\\u2019s needs can shift between day and night.<br \\/><br \\/><b>About this Event<\\/b><br \\/><br \\/><p>This class includes two mini custom moisturizers and guided skincare education. You\\u2019ll create one formula for daytime and one for evening, then learn how texture, moisture, and finish can change depending on when you use it.<\\/p><p>What\\u2019s Included<br \\/>\\u2661 two mini custom moisturizers<br \\/>\\u2661 guided skincare education<br \\/>\\u2661 small group setting<br \\/>\\u2661 limited to 6 spots<\\/p><p>How to Reserve Your Seat<br \\/>Eventbrite is being used as the listing page only.<\\/p><p>Booking is not complete until you reserve your seat through Vagaro:<br \\/>www.vagaro.com\\/backbarskincare\\/classes<\\/p>\",\"end_time\":\"1783969200\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"Back Bar Skincare\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"2607 South Southeast Boulevard\",\"venue\":\"Back Bar Skincare\",\"city\":\"Spokane\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.6308061\",\"longitude\":\"-117.3745189\",\"full_address\":\"Back Bar Skincare, 2607 South Southeast Boulevard, Spokane, United States\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/100001991010727683?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/100001991010727683?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nDay + Night \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/100001991010727683?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nDay + Night \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/100001991010727683?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/100001991010727683\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false,\"ticket_currency\":\"USD\",\"min_ticket_price\":\"0.00\",\"max_ticket_price\":\"0.00\"},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false,\"ticket_currency\":\"USD\",\"min_ticket_price\":\"0.00\",\"max_ticket_price\":\"0.00\"},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030220783712\",\"eventname\":\"Play with Color and Composition Summer Camp (ages 6-8) with Tracy Spain\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/83bcca0cfc1a2332e8f030b64085417c277cce07af0798f06df763e70d5dde87-rimg-w1200-h1200-dcaaa590-gmir?v=1783434318\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/83bcca0cfc1a2332e8f030b64085417c277cce07af0798f06df763e70d5dde87-rimg-w1200-h1200-dcaaa590-gmir?v=1783434318\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/83bcca0cfc1a2332e8f030b64085417c277cce07af0798f06df763e70d5dde87-rimg-w1200-h1200-dcaaa590-gmir?v=1783434318\",\"start_time\":\"1783933200\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"This class is Monday-Friday, July 13-17\\n9:00-10:30 a.m.\\n$110\\n\\nYoung artists will explore the exciting world of color and space through drawing and painting! In this hands-on class, students will learn how to mix the primary colors to create a rainbow of new colors while experimenting with paint in fun and creative ways. Artists will also be introduced to the basics of perspective and distance, discovering how to make objects appear near or far in their artwork. Through playful projects and guided instruction, students will build confidence in their artistic skills while developing a stronger understanding of color, composition, and visual storytelling.\\n\\nMonday: Learn about primary and secondary colors. Practice color mixing with watercolor, and try creating a color wheel.\\n\\nTuesday: Learn about foreground and background in a landscape scene. Understand what makes an object appear close or distant. Practice distance creating a landscape with drawing materials and watercolors.\\n\\nWednesday: Learn more about distance and perspective in a cityscape scene. \\n\\nThursday: Practice making a cityscape with drawing materials and watercolors.\\n\\nFriday: Practice making your own final masterpiece using perspective and color mixing.\",\"end_time\":\"1783938600\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"Spokane Art School, 503 E 2nd Ave, Suite B, Spokane, WA, United States, Washington 99202\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"503 E 2nd Ave, Spokane, WA 99202-1405, United States\",\"venue\":\"Spokane Art School, 503 E 2nd Ave, Suite B, Spokane, WA, United States, Washington 99202\",\"city\":\"Spokane\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.65489\",\"longitude\":\"-117.40337\",\"full_address\":\"Spokane Art School, 503 E 2nd Ave, Suite B, Spokane, WA, United States, Washington 99202\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/200030220783712?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030220783712?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nPlay with Color and Composition Summer Camp (ages 6-8) with Tracy Spain \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030220783712?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nPlay with Color and Composition Summer Camp (ages 6-8) with Tracy Spain \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030220783712?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/200030220783712\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030369374817\",\"eventname\":\"Gundam Card Game Monday\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events9\\/banners\\/7e54df33a7b4669