ibes, you won\\u2019t want to miss it.\\n\",\"end_time\":\"1783976400\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"6501 N Cedar Rd, Bldg 3 Suite A, Spokane, WA, United States, Washington 99208\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"6501 N Cedar Rd, Spokane, WA 99208-4571, United States\",\"venue\":\"6501 N Cedar Rd, Bldg 3 Suite A, Spokane, WA, United States, Washington 99208\",\"city\":\"Spokane\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.71714\",\"longitude\":\"-117.43305\",\"full_address\":\"6501 N Cedar Rd, Bldg 3 Suite A, Spokane, WA, United States, Washington 99208\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/200030356018008?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030356018008?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nBoiler Room Bingo \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030356018008?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Spokane on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nBoiler Room Bingo \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030356018008?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/200030356018008\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030369344029\",\"eventname\":\"WHEN Texas Roadhouse Event on July 13th for a Dine and Donate. \",\"thumb_url\":\"h