totally go!\\n\\nWHEN Texas Roadhouse Event on July 13th for a Dine and Donate.  \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/200030369344029?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/spokane\\/event\\/200030369344029\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030347222809\",\"eventname\":\"Stache Ranch Experience\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/79da8478d364e6094d9a5b927ef14440a46fdff94b56eccaaf4160fb97493e76-rimg-w1200-h1600-dca18f7e-gmir?v=1783055468\",\"thumb_url_large\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/79da8478d364e6094d9a5b927ef14440a46fdff94b56eccaaf4160fb97493e76-rimg-w1200-h1600-dca18f7e-gmir?v=1783055468\",\"banner_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.in\\/events1\\/banners\\/79da8478d364e6094d9a5b927ef14440a46fdff94b56eccaaf4160fb97493e76-rimg-w1200-h1600-dca18f7e-gmir?v=1783055468\",\"start_time\":\"1783929600\",\"timezone\":\"-07:00\",\"description\":\"This is a full-day, hands-on working session built around one question:\\n\\nCan you and your horse actually do the work\\u2014safely, confidently, and with feel?\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nWhat this is\\n\\nEach day is a private ranch experience for you and your horse.\\n\\nWe\\u2019re not chasing patterns first.\\nWe\\u2019re building the foundation that makes patterns easy.\\n\\nThat means we work on real-world ranch and performance skills:\\n\\n* Working gates without losing control of the body\\n* Roping fundamentals (position, timing, control)\\n* Dallying safely and correctly\\n* Dragging with confidence, not tension\\n* Forward motion with brakes, not chaos\\n* Softness under pressure, not bracing\\n\\nOnce the job is solid, then we expand into:\\n\\n* Ranch riding patterns\\n* Transitions that actually hold under pressure\\n* Maneuvers that don\\u2019t fall apart when speed increases\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nThe philosophy\\n\\nMost riders try to \\u201cdo the pattern\\u201d and hope the horse figures it out.\\n\\nHere, you do the opposite:\\n\\nYou build the horse that can handle the job first.\\n\\n* Control the body parts \\u2192 the job becomes easy\\n* Slow it down \\u2192 precision shows up\\n* Get clarity first \\u2192 speed becomes safe\\n* Fix feel \\u2192 performance follows\\n\\nIf your horse can\\u2019t stay organized in the basics, it won\\u2019t stay organized in anything else.\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nSchedule\\n\\n8:00 AM \\u2013 4:00 PM (each rider day)\\n\\n* Morning groundwork + riding evaluation\\n* Job-specific skill building\\n* Break for lunch (on-site or nearby)\\n* Afternoon application under light pressure\\n* Real-world repetition until it holds\\n\\nThis is not a clinic where you watch.\\nYou ride. You repeat. You fix. You leave with clarity.\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nWho this is for\\n\\nThis is for you if:\\n\\n* Your horse \\u201ckind of\\u201d does things but not consistently\\n* Gates, roping, or dragging feel messy or unsafe\\n* You avoid pressure situations because things fall apart\\n* You want real ranch confidence, not just arena survival\\n* You\\u2019re ready to slow down to speed up\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nInvestment\\n\\n$250 per rider \\/ per day\\n\\nLimited to 1\\u20133 riders per day so every session stays focused and individualized.\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nLocation\\n\\nStache Ranch\\nGreenacres, Washington (Spokane area)\\n\\n\\u2e3b\\n\\nHow to book\\n\\nMessage directly to claim a day.\\n\\nMonday - Booked\\nTuesday - 1 spot taken\\nWednesday -Open\\nThursday -Open\\nFriday -BOOKED\\nSaturday -Open\\n\\nOnce a day is filled, it\\u2019s closed\\u2014no stacking riders past capacity.\",\"end_time\":\"1783958400\",\"start_time_display\":\"Jul 13\",\"location\":\"6803 s Linke rd Greenacres, WA 99016\",\"venue\":{\"street\":\"6803 S Linke Rd, Greenacres, WA 99016-8715, United States\",\"venue\":\"6803 s Linke rd Greenacres, WA 99016\",\"city\":\"Greenacres\",\"state\":\"WA\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"latitude\":\"47.58931\",\"longitude\":\"-117.17922\",\"full_address\":\"6803 s Linke rd Greenacres, WA 99016, 6803 S Linke Rd, Greenacres, WA 99016-8715, United States\"},\"label\":\"Today\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"event_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/greenacres\\/event\\/200030347222809?ref=eventsearch-event-results\",\"share_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/greenacres\\/200030347222809?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Greenacres on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nStache Ranch Experience \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/greenacres\\/200030347222809?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"share_message_wa\":\"Hey, \\n\\nJust found this amazing event happening in Greenacres on AllEvents.\\n\\nWe should totally go!\\n\\nStache Ranch Experience \\n\\n Check it out: https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/greenacres\\/200030347222809?ref=bottom_sharer_app\",\"object_type\":\"events\",\"end_url\":\"https:\\/\\/allevents.in\\/greenacres\\/event\\/200030347222809\",\"distance\":0,\"ticket\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"tickets\":{\"has_tickets\":false},\"recurring_event_details\":{\"has_slots\":false},\"display_day\":\"13\",\"display_month\":\"Jul\",\"display_end_day\":null,\"interested_count\":0,\"custom_params\":{\"total_interested_count\":0},\"params\":[],\"app_display_time\":\"Mon, 13 Jul, 2026\",\"display_time_label\":\"Mon, 13 Jul\",\"card_custom_details\":null,\"show_story_share\":true},{\"event_id\":\"200030167833407\",\"eventname\":\"Meal\\/Hygiene Kit Making (Volunteer Opp)\",\"thumb_url\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn-az.allevents.i